dialect protocol
protocol stdio.semio.flow.mutations
version 1
schema stdio.semio.flow
start body
framing record

# P2 pilot (flow): REAL binary op frame, replacing the old `print_op().into_bytes()`
# text-as-binary shortcut (`🧬️mutations/🦀️component.rs`'s old `OpBinary::encode_op`).
# `SemioFlowMutation` is a genuine data-carrying enum whose variants embed nested
# `FlowNode`/`FlowEdge`/`SemioFlowSnapshot` payloads — no `dsl::DslField` impl exists
# for any of them (hand-rolled per this subset's own `🔺️diff`/`🧬️mutations` convention), so the
# generic derive-based `format u8 | ordinal varint | record body` layout doesn't apply. Handcrafted
# instead: `format u8` (`OP_BINARY_FORMAT` convention) + `tag u8` (the `SemioFlowMutation`
# variant ordinal, `🧬️mutations/🦀️component.rs`'s `OP_KEYWORDS`/`variant_ordinal`, same 0-12
# ordering as `parse_flow_mutation`'s keyword match) as two REAL fixed fields, then the
# variant's own `key=value ...` argument payload as one opaque trailing `bytes` chain — the same
# honest boundary the sibling `../../🔺️diff/💾️binary/📡️component.protocol.semio` uses (filed once,
# applies to both facets — see this wave's report `mechanism_gaps`,
# `protocol-array-of-records`/`protocol-prim-ref-recursion`).
header fixed 2
field format u8
field tag u8

chain payload bytes
